            "value": "指令面板…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Command history is off by default, because a terminal's history is among the most sensitive things a device can hold. Turn it on in Settings if you want it; it stays on this device and can be cleared at any time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命令历史记录默认关闭，因为终端的历史记录属于设备上最敏感的内容之一。如果需要，可在设置中开启；它仅保留在本设备上，并可随时清除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指令歷史紀錄預設關閉，因為終端機的歷史紀錄屬於裝置上最敏感的內容之一。若有需要，可在設定中開啟；它僅保留在本裝置上，並可隨時清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Command history is stored only on this device and is off by default. Turning it off deletes what has been recorded.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命令历史记录仅存储在本设备上，且默认关闭。关闭后将删除已记录的内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指令歷史紀錄僅儲存在本裝置上，且預設關閉。關閉後將刪除已記錄的內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Command history is stored only on this device and is off by default. Turning it off deletes what has been recorded. Spotlight is off too: turning it on gives the names and addresses of your connections to this device's search index, where they can be found without opening the app. Turning it off removes them again. Passwords, keys and host keys are never indexed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命令历史仅存储在本设备上，且默认关闭。关闭它会删除已记录的内容。Spotlight 同样默认关闭：开启后，本应用会把您各条连接的名称与地址交给本设备的搜索索引，使其无需打开应用即可被搜索到；关闭后会再次移除。密码、密钥与 host key 从不被索引。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指令歷史僅儲存在本裝置上，且預設關閉。關閉它會刪除已記錄的內容。Spotlight 同樣預設關閉：開啟後，本應用程式會將您各條連線的名稱與位址交給本裝置的搜尋索引，使其不必開啟應用程式即可被搜尋到；關閉後會再次移除。密碼、金鑰與 host key 從不被索引。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Commands": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
