    "Connect through one or more saved connections, in order — the equivalent of `ssh -J`. Each hop is a connection of its own: its own credentials, and its own host key checked against its own record.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按顺序经由一个或多个已保存的连接接入——相当于 `ssh -J`。每一跳都是独立的连接：有自己的凭据，主机密钥也按自己的记录单独核对。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按順序經由一個或多個已儲存的連線接入——相當於 `ssh -J`。每一跳都是獨立的連線：有自己的憑證，主機金鑰也按自己的紀錄單獨核對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
