    "Credentials are stored in the Keychain, never in the connection list. Leave the password empty to be asked each time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "凭据存储在 Keychain 中，绝不会存入连接列表。将密码留空，则每次都会询问。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "憑據儲存在 Keychain 中，絕不會存入連線列表。將密碼留空，則每次都會詢問。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Credentials are stored in the Keychain, never in the connection list. Leave the password empty to be asked each time. With no key and no password chosen, the server is asked what it takes and you are asked for a password only if it takes one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "凭据保存在钥匙串中，绝不会进入连接列表。密码留空则每次询问。既不选密钥也不选密码时，会先询问服务器接受哪些方式，仅当服务器接受密码时才向您询问密码。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "憑證儲存在鑰匙圈中，絕不會進入連線列表。密碼留空則每次詢問。既不選金鑰也不選密碼時，會先詢問伺服器接受哪些方式，僅當伺服器接受密碼時才向您詢問密碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
