    "For a screen published as its own Cloudflare Tunnel hostname — the tunnel's ingress pointing at the VNC server. The picture travels inside the tunnel's TLS, and no cloudflared install is needed on this device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于以自己的 Cloudflare Tunnel 主机名发布的屏幕——隧道的 ingress 指向 VNC 服务器。画面在隧道的 TLS 内部传输，本设备无需安装 cloudflared。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "適用於以自己的 Cloudflare Tunnel 主機名稱發布的螢幕——通道的 ingress 指向 VNC 伺服器。畫面在通道的 TLS 內部傳輸，本裝置無需安裝 cloudflared。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
