    "Leave the address as 127.0.0.1 unless the server's sshd sets GatewayPorts — without it, a request to bind anything else is refused. Port 0 asks the server to choose.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "除非服务器的 sshd 设置了 GatewayPorts，否则请保持地址为 127.0.0.1——没有它，绑定其它地址的请求会被拒绝。端口填 0 表示让服务器自己选。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "除非伺服器的 sshd 設定了 GatewayPorts，否則請保持位址為 127.0.0.1——沒有它，綁定其它位址的請求會被拒絕。連接埠填 0 表示讓伺服器自己選。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
