    "Links can come from anywhere — a web page, a message, a code on a wall. Check the server below is one you meant to reach. Opening it adds nothing to your connections until you save it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "链接可能来自任何地方——网页、消息、墙上的二维码。请确认下方的服务器正是您想连接的那一台。打开它并不会向您的连接列表中添加任何内容，除非您自行保存。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連結可能來自任何地方——網頁、訊息、牆上的二維條碼。請確認下方的伺服器正是您想連線的那一台。開啟它並不會向您的連線清單中新增任何內容，除非您自行儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Links can come from anywhere — a web page, a message, a code on a wall. Nothing is sent to the server until you allow it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
