        }
      }
    },
    "Off until you turn it on": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭，由你开启"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設關閉，由你開啟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off. Opening this connection starts an ordinary shell, and what is running in it ends when the connection does.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭。打开此连接会启动普通 shell，其中运行的内容会随连接一同结束。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關閉。開啟此連線會啟動一般 shell，其中執行的內容會隨連線一併結束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off. Programs on the server cannot use your key. Turn this on only if you need to reach another server, or a Git remote, from a shell on this one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已关闭。服务器上的程序无法使用你的密钥。仅当你需要从这台服务器的 shell 连接到另一台服务器或 Git 远端时才开启。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已關閉。伺服器上的程式無法使用你的金鑰。僅當你需要從這台伺服器的 shell 連線到另一台伺服器或 Git 遠端時才開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offer a password": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提供密码"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提供密碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offered together with the key. The server checks it against its own authority instead of looking the key up in a file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与密钥一起提供。服务器会拿它和自己的颁发机构核对，而不是去文件里查这把密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "與金鑰一起提供。伺服器會拿它和自己的憑發機構核對，而不是去檔案裡查這把金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离线"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "離線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a Mac, turn on Screen Sharing and allow your account, or set “VNC viewers may control screen with password”. On other servers, enable VNC or VeNCrypt password authentication.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 上，请开启“屏幕共享”并允许你的账户，或设置“VNC 显示程序可以使用密码控制屏幕”。在其他服务器上，请启用 VNC 或 VeNCrypt 密码验证。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 上，請開啟「螢幕共享」並允許你的帳號，或設定「VNC 檢視器可以使用密碼控制螢幕」。在其他伺服器上，請啟用 VNC 或 VeNCrypt 密碼驗證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a Mac, turn on “VNC viewers may control screen with password” in Screen Sharing settings. On other servers, enable VNC password authentication.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 上，请在“屏幕共享”设置中开启“VNC 显示程序可以使用密码控制屏幕”。在其他服务器上，请启用 VNC 密码验证。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 上，請在「螢幕共享」設定中開啟「VNC 檢視器可以使用密碼控制螢幕」。在其他伺服器上，請啟用 VNC 密碼驗證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a first connection only you can tell your server from an impostor. Check the fingerprint once; after that it is remembered, and a key that changes is refused until you say otherwise.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次连接时，只有你能分辨真正的服务器和冒充者。核对一次指纹即可，之后会被记住；密钥若发生变化，在你另行确认之前一律拒绝。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次連線時，只有你能分辨真正的伺服器和冒充者。核對一次指紋即可，之後會被記住；金鑰若發生變化，在你另行確認之前一律拒絕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the server, run:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在服务器上运行："
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在伺服器上執行："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only fonts where every character is the same width are offered: a terminal draws a grid, and a font that does not measure evenly draws a screen that does not line up. Ligatures are off by default because a font that draws != as one glyph is drawing two cells as one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅提供每个字符等宽的字体：终端绘制的是网格，而宽度不一致的字体会画出对不齐的屏幕。连字默认关闭，因为把 != 画成一个字形的字体，是在把两个单元格画成一个。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅提供每個字元等寬的字體：終端機繪製的是格線，而寬度不一致的字體會畫出對不齊的畫面。連字預設關閉，因為把 != 畫成一個字形的字體，是在把兩個儲存格畫成一個。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
