    },
    "Opening this connection attaches to a tmux session on the server, creating it if it is not there. What is running stays running when you disconnect, and tmux decides how the panes are arranged. tmux must be installed on the server.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开此连接会接入服务器上的 tmux 会话；若不存在则创建它。断开连接后，其中运行的内容仍会继续运行，窗格的排布由 tmux 决定。服务器上必须已安装 tmux。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟此連線會接上伺服器上的 tmux 工作階段；若不存在則建立它。中斷連線後，其中執行的內容仍會繼續執行，而窗格的排列由 tmux 決定。伺服器上必須已安裝 tmux。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens a connection and puts one of your saved snippets into it. Whether it runs straight away is the snippet's own setting.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开一条连接，并把您保存的某个片段放入其中。它是否立即运行，取决于该片段自身的设置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟一條連線，並將您儲存的某個指令片段放入其中。它是否立即執行，取決於該片段本身的設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
