          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "貼上 OpenSSH 私密金鑰，以 -----BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY----- 開頭。它儲存在 Keychain 中，絕不會離開本裝置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste deploy@build.example.com:2222 into the hostname field and it is taken apart for you. A blank port means the usual one; a blank user name is asked for when you connect.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把 deploy@build.example.com:2222 粘贴到主机名一栏，它会自动拆分。端口留空表示使用默认端口；用户名留空则在连接时询问。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把 deploy@build.example.com:2222 貼到主機名稱一欄，它會自動拆分。連接埠留空表示使用預設連接埠；使用者名稱留空則在連線時詢問。"
