    "Private keys live in Apple's Keychain and are never sent to a server. iCloud sync is not available in this version, so nothing you save leaves this device at all.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私钥保存在 Apple 的钥匙串中，绝不会发送到任何服务器。此版本暂不开放 iCloud 同步，因此你保存的一切都不会离开本设备。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私密金鑰儲存在 Apple 的鑰匙圈中，絕不會傳送到任何伺服器。此版本暫不開放 iCloud 同步，因此你儲存的一切都不會離開本裝置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Private keys live in Apple's Keychain and are never sent to a server. iCloud sync is off until you turn it on, and even then only keys you choose go to iCloud Keychain.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私钥存放在 Apple 的 Keychain 中，从不发送到服务器。iCloud 同步在您开启之前处于关闭状态；即使开启，也只有您选择的密钥才会进入 iCloud Keychain。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私密金鑰存放在 Apple 的 Keychain 中，絕不會傳送至伺服器。iCloud 同步在您開啟之前處於關閉狀態；即使開啟，也只有您選擇的金鑰才會進入 iCloud Keychain。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Private keys stay in this device's Keychain and never reach a server. There is no account and no analytics. Nothing is synced anywhere yet, and a passcode or Face ID is there if you want the app itself locked.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私钥保存在本设备的钥匙串中，绝不会发送到任何服务器。没有账户，也没有任何统计分析。目前不会同步到任何地方；如果你想锁住应用本身，可以设置密码或 Face ID。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私密金鑰儲存在本裝置的鑰匙圈中，絕不會傳送到任何伺服器。沒有帳號，也沒有任何統計分析。目前不會同步到任何地方；若你想鎖住 App 本身，可以設定密碼或 Face ID。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Private keys stay in this device's Keychain and never reach a server. There is no account and no analytics. Turn on iCloud sync, or a passcode and Face ID, only if you want them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私钥保存在本设备的钥匙串中，绝不会发送到任何服务器。没有账户，也没有任何统计分析。iCloud 同步、密码锁和 Face ID 都由你自行决定是否开启。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私密金鑰儲存在本裝置的鑰匙圈中，絕不會傳送到任何伺服器。沒有帳號，也沒有任何統計分析。iCloud 同步、密碼鎖和 Face ID 都由你自行決定是否開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Private keys stay in this device's Keychain, or inside the Secure Enclave where they cannot be extracted at all. There is no account and no analytics. A passcode or Face ID can lock the app itself, and the guide is under Settings whenever you want it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私钥留在本设备的 Keychain 中，或留在 Secure Enclave 内部——在那里它根本无法被导出。没有账户，也没有分析统计。密码或 Face ID 可以锁定应用本身，而指南随时都在“设置”中等着您。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私密金鑰留在本裝置的 Keychain 中，或留在 Secure Enclave 內部——在那裡它根本無法被匯出。沒有帳號，也沒有分析統計。密碼或 Face ID 可以鎖定應用程式本身，而指南隨時都在「設定」中等著您。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
