        }
      }
    },
    "Sent to %@. Only the text shown here is sent: the question, the server's platform, the last command, and the terminal text you chose.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发送至 %@。仅发送此处显示的文本：问题、服务器平台、最后一条命令，以及您选择的终端文本。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "傳送至 %@。僅傳送此處顯示的文字：問題、伺服器平台、最後一個指令，以及您選擇的終端機文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Separated by commas, in OpenSSH's style: `*.example.com` matches any host under it, `?` matches one character. An authority is trusted only for the hosts it matches — `*` trusts it for every server in the world.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用逗号分隔，写法与 OpenSSH 相同：`*.example.com` 匹配其下任意主机，`?` 匹配一个字符。颁发机构只对匹配到的主机受信任——`*` 等于信任它担保世界上任何一台服务器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用逗號分隔，寫法與 OpenSSH 相同：`*.example.com` 比對其下任意主機，`?` 比對一個字元。憑發機構只對比對到的主機受信任——`*` 等於信任它擔保世界上任何一台伺服器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
