    "Syncing is not available in this version. Everything stays on this device, which is where it already was — nothing you have saved is affected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本暂不开放同步。所有内容都留在本设备上——本来也在这里，你已保存的一切都不受影响。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本暫不開放同步。所有內容都留在本裝置上——本來也在這裡，你已儲存的一切都不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Syncing…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在同步…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在同步…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Syncs connections, key names and public keys, snippets and trusted host keys between your devices through your own iCloud account. Private keys are added to iCloud Keychain only when you choose that for a key, and keys protected by Face ID or Touch ID never leave this device. Passwords, command history and diagnostics are not synced.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过您自己的 iCloud 账户，在您的设备之间同步连接、密钥名称和公钥、片段以及已信任的 host key。只有当您为某个密钥选择了 iCloud Keychain 时，私钥才会加入 iCloud Keychain；受 Face ID 或 Touch ID 保护的密钥从不离开本设备。密码、命令历史和诊断信息不同步。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透過您自己的 iCloud 帳號，在您的裝置之間同步連線、金鑰名稱與公開金鑰、指令片段以及已信任的 host key。只有當您為某把金鑰選擇了 iCloud Keychain 時，私密金鑰才會加入 iCloud Keychain；受 Face ID 或 Touch ID 保護的金鑰絕不會離開本裝置。密碼、指令歷史與診斷資訊不會同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
