          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法以文字形式讀取該檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file is not an Apex Terminal backup.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文件不是 Apex Terminal 的备份。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "該檔案不是 Apex Terminal 的備份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file or folder is no longer there.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文件或文件夹已不存在。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "該檔案或資料夾已不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is a host certificate. A key is authenticated with a user certificate; a host certificate belongs to a server.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是一张主机证书。密钥认证要用用户证书；主机证书属于服务器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這是一張主機憑證。金鑰認證要用使用者憑證；主機憑證屬於伺服器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is not a public key this app can read.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本 App 无法读取该公钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本 App 無法讀取該公鑰。"
