          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Cloudflare edge answered.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloudflare 边缘节点已响应。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloudflare 邊緣節點已回應。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The SSH connection this screen goes through no longer exists.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此屏幕经由的 SSH 连接已不存在。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此螢幕經由的 SSH 連線已不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Secure Enclave asks for a biometric or passcode check before every signature, and destroys the key if the device's biometric enrolment changes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave 会在每次签名前要求生物识别或密码验证；如果设备的生物识别录入发生变化，密钥将被销毁。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave 會在每次簽章前要求生物辨識或密碼驗證；若裝置的生物辨識登錄發生變更，金鑰將被銷毀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Secure Enclave destroys its copy. There is no backup anywhere, so this key can never be recovered and any connection using it will stop working.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave 会销毁它保存的副本。任何地方都没有备份，因此这把密钥永远无法恢复，使用它的连接都将无法继续工作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave 會銷毀它保存的副本。任何地方都沒有備份，因此這把金鑰永遠無法復原，使用它的連線都將無法繼續運作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address as the SSH server sees it. For that server's own desktop this is 127.0.0.1; for another machine on its network, that machine's address. A pasted address carrying its port is taken apart.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此地址是 SSH 服务器所看到的地址。若是该服务器自己的桌面，请填 127.0.0.1；若是其网络中的另一台机器，请填那台机器的地址。粘贴的带端口地址会被自动拆分。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此位址是 SSH 伺服器所看到的位址。若是該伺服器自己的桌面，請填 127.0.0.1；若是其網路中的另一台機器，請填那台機器的位址。貼上的帶連接埠位址會被自動拆分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address this device dials. A pasted address carrying its port is taken apart.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本设备直接拨号的地址。粘贴的带端口地址会被自动拆分。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本裝置直接撥號的位址。貼上的帶連接埠位址會被自動拆分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app cannot tell a real server from an impostor on a first connection. Compare the fingerprint it shows with what the server reports. A changed key is always refused until you decide.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次连接时，本应用无法分辨真实服务器与冒充者。请将显示的 fingerprint 与服务器自身报告的进行比对。已更改的密钥总是会被拒绝，直到您作出决定。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次連線時，本應用程式無法分辨真實伺服器與冒充者。請將顯示的 fingerprint 與伺服器自身回報的內容比對。已變更的金鑰一律會被拒絕，直到您做出決定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app was out of touch with iCloud for too long. The next sync fetches everything again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本应用与 iCloud 失去联系的时间过长。下次同步会重新获取全部内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本 App 與 iCloud 失去聯繫的時間過長。下次同步會重新取得全部內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app's iCloud data was removed. It is recreated on the next sync.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本应用在 iCloud 中的数据已被移除，将在下次同步时重新创建。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本 App 在 iCloud 中的資料已被移除，將在下次同步時重新建立。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The authority's own public key — the `.pub` file, not a certificate. Check its fingerprint against what the authority's owner published before trusting it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颁发机构自己的公钥——是 `.pub` 文件，不是证书。信任它之前，请把指纹与机构所有者公布的值核对一遍。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "憑發機構自己的公鑰——是 `.pub` 檔案，不是憑證。信任它之前，請把指紋與機構擁有者公布的值核對一遍。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
