          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hostname could not be reached.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法连接到该主机名。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法連線到該主機名稱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hostname the tunnel publishes, and the port the Cloudflare edge is reached on. Where the screen is behind the tunnel is the tunnel's own business.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道发布的主机名，以及访问 Cloudflare 边缘所用的端口。屏幕在隧道背后的位置由隧道自己决定。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通道發布的主機名稱，以及存取 Cloudflare 邊緣所用的連接埠。螢幕在通道背後的位置由通道自己決定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key can only be used after a successful biometric or passcode check, and becomes unusable if the device's biometric enrolment changes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此密钥只有在生物识别或设备密码验证通过后才能使用；如果设备上录入的生物识别信息发生变化，此密钥将无法再使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此金鑰只有在生物辨識或裝置密碼驗證通過後才能使用；若裝置上註冊的生物辨識資料變更，此金鑰將無法再使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key is created inside dedicated hardware and never exists outside it. It cannot be exported, included in a backup, or moved to another device — if you lose this device, the key is gone and you remove its public key from your servers.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密钥在专用硬件内部生成，且从不在其之外存在。它无法导出、无法写入备份，也无法迁移到其他设备——一旦丢失本设备，密钥即随之消失，你需要从服务器上删除它的公钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "金鑰在專用硬體內部產生，且從不在其之外存在。它無法匯出、無法寫入備份，也無法遷移到其他裝置——一旦遺失本裝置，金鑰即隨之消失，你需要從伺服器上刪除它的公開金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key is stored in the Keychain. It can be exported into an encrypted backup and restored onto another device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密钥保存在钥匙串中。它可以导出到加密备份，并在其他设备上恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "金鑰保存在鑰匙圈中。它可以匯出到加密備份，並在其他裝置上復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The on-device model could not answer: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
