            "state": "translated",
            "value": "裝置端模型已在「設定」中關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The on-device model needs iOS 26.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备端模型需要 iOS 26。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "裝置端模型需要 iOS 26。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The only algorithm the Secure Enclave signs with. Every current OpenSSH server accepts it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave 唯一支持的签名算法。当前所有 OpenSSH 服务器都接受它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave 唯一支援的簽章演算法。目前所有 OpenSSH 伺服器都接受它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The passcode is the app's own, separate from the device passcode. It is never stored — only a salted derivation of it, on this device. Wrong guesses are slowed down, never punished by deleting anything.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此密码是应用自己的，与设备密码无关。密码本身不会被保存——只保存加盐的派生值，且仅在本设备上。输错只会被延迟，绝不会删除任何数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此密碼是 App 自己的，與裝置密碼無關。密碼本身不會被儲存——只保存加鹽的衍生值，且僅在本裝置上。輸錯只會被延遲，絕不會刪除任何資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The password is the one typed when the backup was exported. It is not stored anywhere and cannot be recovered.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码就是导出备份时输入的那一个。它没有保存在任何地方，也无法找回。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密碼就是匯出備份時輸入的那一個。它沒有儲存在任何地方，也無法找回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The private key is removed from this device and any connection using it will stop working. This cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私钥将从本设备移除，所有使用它的连接都将无法继续工作。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私密金鑰將從本裝置移除，所有使用它的連線都將無法繼續運作。此操作無法復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The provider answered %lld: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务提供方返回 %lld：%@"
