    },
    "The screen sharing server refused the password.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕共享服务器拒绝了密码。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "螢幕共享伺服器拒絕了密碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen sharing session has ended.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕共享会话已结束。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "螢幕共享工作階段已結束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen travels inside that connection, so the VNC server can stay bound to the server's own localhost and nothing extra is exposed. Its encryption is SSH's.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面在该连接内部传输，因此 VNC 服务器可以只绑定服务器自己的 localhost，无需额外暴露任何端口。其加密即 SSH 的加密。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "畫面在該連線內部傳輸，因此 VNC 伺服器可以只繫結伺服器自己的 localhost，無需額外暴露任何連接埠。其加密即 SSH 的加密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen travels inside the SSH connection, so nothing extra is exposed and the VNC server can stay bound to localhost. Leave the address empty for the server itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面在 SSH 连接内传输，因此无需额外暴露任何端口，VNC 服务器可以只绑定 localhost。地址留空即表示服务器本身。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "畫面在 SSH 連線內傳輸，因此無需額外暴露任何連接埠，VNC 伺服器可以只繫結 localhost。位址留空即表示伺服器本身。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server could not %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器无法%@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伺服器無法%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server listens. Anything that connects to it there is carried back to a destination this device can reach.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由服务器监听。连到那里的流量会被带回本设备能访问的目标。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由伺服器監聽。連到那裡的流量會被帶回本裝置能存取的目標。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server offers only screen sharing security types this app does not support.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器只提供此应用不支持的屏幕共享安全类型。"
