          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This connection is set to use a Cloudflare Access service token, but none is stored on this device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此连接设置为使用 Cloudflare Access 服务令牌，但本设备上未存储任何令牌。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此連線設定為使用 Cloudflare Access 服務權杖，但本裝置上未儲存任何權杖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes the only reference to a key that has never existed outside the Secure Enclave, and nothing can rebuild it. There is no backup anywhere, so the key is gone for good and any connection using it will stop working.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将删除指向该密钥的唯一引用，而这把密钥从未在 Secure Enclave 之外存在过，任何方式都无法重建它。任何地方都没有备份，因此密钥将永久消失，使用它的连接都将无法继续工作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這將刪除指向該金鑰的唯一參照，而這把金鑰從未在 Secure Enclave 之外存在過，任何方式都無法重建它。任何地方都沒有備份，因此金鑰將永久消失，使用它的連線都將無法繼續運作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device cannot run Apple Intelligence.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备无法运行 Apple 智能。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此裝置無法執行 Apple Intelligence。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device listens as a SOCKS5 proxy. Each client picks its own destination, which the server then connects to — one rule instead of one per address.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本设备作为 SOCKS5 代理监听。每个客户端各自指定目标，再由服务器去连接——一条规则顶一批地址。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本裝置作為 SOCKS5 代理監聽。每個用戶端各自指定目標，再由伺服器去連線——一條規則抵一批位址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device listens. Anything that connects is carried through the server to the destination — the way to reach a database that only the server can see.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由本设备监听。连进来的流量经服务器送到目标——用来访问只有服务器能看到的数据库。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由本裝置監聽。連進來的流量經伺服器送到目標——用來存取只有伺服器能看到的資料庫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
