    },
    "When a connection drops, Apex Terminal retries on its own and as soon as the network comes back. Your scrollback is kept, and the new shell is marked in the terminal — it starts fresh, in the home directory, with nothing running.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接断开时，Apex Terminal 会自行重试，并在网络恢复后立即重试。回滚记录会保留，新的 shell 会在终端中标出——它是全新的，位于主目录，没有任何程序在运行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連線中斷時，Apex Terminal 會自行重試，並在網路恢復後立即重試。回捲紀錄會保留，新的 shell 會在終端機中標示出來——它是全新的，位於主目錄，沒有任何程式在執行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the private key lives": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私钥存放在哪里"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私密金鑰存放在哪裡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you are connected, anything running as root on this server can ask your device to sign with this key — including for connections to other servers. It cannot read the key, and signing stops the moment you disconnect. Turn this on for machines you trust; leave it off for shared ones.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你连接期间，这台服务器上任何以 root 身份运行的程序都可以请求你的设备用这把密钥签名——包括用于连接其他服务器。它无法读取密钥，断开连接后签名即刻停止。请只对你信任的机器开启；共享机器请保持关闭。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你連線期間，這台伺服器上任何以 root 身分執行的程式都可以請求你的裝置用這把金鑰簽章——包括用於連線其他伺服器。它無法讀取金鑰，中斷連線後簽章即刻停止。請只對你信任的機器開啟；共享機器請保持關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
