    "⌘D splits a session to the right, ⇧⌘D downwards, and the Session menu does the same without a keyboard. Two shells, a shell and a remote screen, or four of either — drag the divider to share the space.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘D 向右拆分会话，⇧⌘D 向下拆分；没有键盘时，“会话”菜单可以做同样的事。两个 shell、一个 shell 加一个远程屏幕，或者四个任意组合——拖动分隔线来分配空间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘D 向右分割工作階段，⇧⌘D 向下分割；沒有鍵盤時，「工作階段」選單可以做同樣的事。兩個 shell、一個 shell 加一個遠端畫面，或四個任意組合——拖曳分隔線來分配空間。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
